# LAMMPS Input File
# Licensed under CC BY 4.0
# See more in "A Set of Materials-Science Tutorials for the LAMMPS Simulation Package: 2. Materials Science"
# By Simon Gravelle, Mark A. Tschopp, Jacob R. Gissinger, and Axel Kohlmeyer

# 1) Initialization
units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

# 2) System definition
lattice fcc 4.049 origin 0.25 0.25 0.25
region box block 0 4 0 4 0 4 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box

# 3) Settings
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * Al_zhou.eam.alloy Al

# 4) Monitoring
thermo 100
dump viz all image 100 myimage-*.ppm type type shiny 0.1 box no 0.01 view 0 0 zoom 1.8 fsaa yes size 800 800
dump_modify viz adiam 1 1 acolor 1 turquoise backcolor white
dump traj all atom 100 dump.lammpstrj

# 5) Run
timestep 0.001 # 1 fs
velocity all create 300.0 49284 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix mynpt all npt temp 300 300 0.1 aniso 0 0 1.0 
run 5000